# Cursor operating protocol

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Read `.dentcast/workflows/global/README.md` and all complete active global sections selected by that router for the current edit scope, plus the complete `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md`. They govern conversation, founder messages, capability failures and Git. Legacy files are backup only; do not read them for execution.
New publication follows `.dentcast/workflows/README.md` and all applicable verbatim module rules (complete modules by default, or the verified readpack only after locked Phase B). Staging receipts never replace scientific execution or founder decisions.

**Interrupted publication** («انتشار ناقص داشتم»), the run state `.dentcast/PUBLISH-HANDOFF.md` and recovery through `.dentcast/workflows/publish-handoff.md`: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`, «Interrupted publication».

Ledger and the three fixed deliveries: `.dentcast/workflows/publish-checkpoints.md`.
